# GitHub Packages for @anaconda scope (@anaconda/playwright-utils). The bridge
# payloads opt out with the `npmjs:` specifier and come from the public registry.
# The auth token must be set in ~/.npmrc or via `pnpm config set`:
#   pnpm config set "//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken" <token>
# In CI, inject the token by writing this line into .npmrc with a variable
# reference pnpm expands at read time, e.g.:
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
# (a literal env var named "NPM_CONFIG_//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken"
# is not valid — env var names cannot contain "/" or ":").
@anaconda:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
